 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Fast, as it leverages efficient 2D texture synthesis algorithms. Significantly faster than full 3D volumetric synthesis [S1].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Low, as it does not store explicit 3D volumetric data. Only 2D textures are generated on demand [S1].
